flowchart TD
    AUDIT[Auditor finds defect] --> APPEND[Append SI-NNN row to 02-current-issues.md]
    APPEND --> SEV{Severity?}
    SEV -->|S0 / S1| HOT[Goes into next phase in 03-phase-plan.md]
    SEV -->|S2 / S3| BACKLOG[Stays in 02-current-issues.md backlog]

    HOT --> WAIT[Wait for user to type 'next']
    WAIT --> FIX[Fix lands in OWNING folder, not here]
    FIX --> MOVE[Move row from 02 to 04-closed-issues.md]
    MOVE --> MEM[Update mem://features/spec-issue-tracker.md counts]
    MEM --> SCORE[Add invalidation note to 23-audits readiness score]

    BACKLOG --> REPLAN[Re-grouped in next phase]
    REPLAN --> WAIT
